Starter deck cover image slots

Optional PNG covers go here, using the starter deck ID as the filename:
showdown-fire.png
showdown-water.png
showdown-bridge.png
showdown-mixed.png
showdown-dragon.png

For a future starter with ID my-new-starter, its reserved slot is
my-new-starter.png. No image is required to browse or load a deck. Unknown
decks use the built-in navy-and-gold card-sleeve placeholder. Existing decks
fall back to their real cover card. Missing card art also uses the placeholder.

Prefer portrait cover art at a 5:7 ratio, with the focal subject in the upper
middle. Files are limited to 16 MB / 4 megapixels. Custom cover thumbnails show
the whole image; actual card thumbnails crop to their illustration.

The adjacent deck-art.json can override the filename, fallback cover card,
preview cards, types and summary. Files must remain in this Images folder.
New starter definitions are automatically discovered from ShowdownDecks.All;
the carousel has no five-deck limit. Artwork alone does not create a new deck.
